Register A733 devices under a dedicated sunxi/armv8 subtarget.

A733 combines Cortex-A55 and Cortex-A76 cores. Use OpenWrt's generic AArch64
userspace baseline so every process can run on either cluster without claiming
that the SoC contains Cortex-A53 cores. The external build consumes only the
generic rootfs tarball and supplies the actual A733 kernel and device tree.
